{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Verified Reviews Section
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-reviews-section" id="reviews" style="padding: 80px 0; background: var(--zvhc-bg);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div class="zvhc-section-header">
      <div class="zvhc-eyebrow">VERIFIED EXPERIENCES</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-heading-md">Real Stories. Visible Hair &amp; Scalp Vitality.</h2>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; font-weight: 600;">
        <span style="color: #D48B38; font-size: 1.25rem;">★★★★★</span>
        <span>Customer Verified Experiences · Pure Plant-Powered Botanical Care</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Review Cards Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 40px;">
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: var(--zvhc-radius-md); padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-border); box-shadow: var(--zvhc-shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="color: #D48B38;">★★★★★</div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: #EBF7EE; color: #1E663B; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 700;">Verified Customer</span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--zvhc-font-serif); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-espresso); margin-bottom: 8px;">
          "My hairline feels deeply nourished and so much fuller!"
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-muted); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          After having my second baby, my hairline felt dry and fragile. I started massaging Zavelyn Batana oil regularly before bed. My scalp feels intensely moisturized and my strands are visibly stronger with significantly less breakage. I love this routine!
        </p>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-espresso);">
          Danielle M. <span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--zvhc-muted);">— Atlanta, GA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: var(--zvhc-radius-md); padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-border); box-shadow: var(--zvhc-shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="color: #D48B38;">★★★★★</div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: #EBF7EE; color: #1E663B; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 700;">Verified Customer</span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--zvhc-font-serif); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-espresso); margin-bottom: 8px;">
          "Drastic reduction in breakage and daily shedding"
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-muted); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          I used to see so much hair on my brush every single morning. The combination of pure Batana with rosemary feels so invigorating on the scalp. My strands feel thicker, smoother, and much more resilient!
        </p>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-espresso);">
          Sarah K. <span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--zvhc-muted);">— Charlotte, NC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: var(--zvhc-radius-md); padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-border); box-shadow: var(--zvhc-shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <div style="color: #D48B38;">★★★★★</div>
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; background: #EBF7EE; color: #1E663B; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 700;">Verified Customer</span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--zvhc-font-serif); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-espresso); margin-bottom: 8px;">
          "Authentic, unrefined cold-pressed botanical oil"
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-muted); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          I’ve tried diluted oils on online marketplaces that smelled like artificial perfume. Zavelyn's is the authentic earthy botanical raw oil that truly conditions your hair strands. My natural 4C curl pattern is soft and defined with zero crunchiness!
        </p>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--zvhc-espresso);">
          Brianna W. <span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--zvhc-muted);">— Houston, TX</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

